{{also|vera med}}

==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|vera||to be}} and {{m|is|með||with}}.

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|var|voru|verið|11=með}}

# {{lb|is|with accusative}} to [[have]]
#: ''Ég '''er með''' popp.''
#:: I '''have''' popcorn.
# {{lb|is|with dative|or|elliptically}} to [[take part]] in, to [[join]]
#: ''Má ég '''vera með'''?''
#:: Can I '''join'''?

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|have}} {{l|is|hafa}}
* {{sense|take part}} {{l|is|að vera memm}} (childish)

